  "problem": "MRF walkthroughs could treat official fictional CMS examples as live hospital or payer files. Unknown locator cells could count as supported parsed samples. Difficult frozen 25/10 cohort members could be replaced. An implementer or model could approve its own scientific output. A negotiated rate could be mistaken for observed payment or a legal-compliance judgment.",
